WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.1957213Z Note: a multi-user installation is possible. See https://nix.dev/manual/nix/stable/installation/installing-binary.html#multi-user-installation
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.1967398Z ^[[1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer^[[0m
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.2067438Z ^[[32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.2077681Z ^[[0m
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.2078289Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.2078748Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.2078960Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.2079149Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.2080219Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.2080514Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.2080694Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.2081219Z    if you are ready to continue.
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.2081522Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.2082084Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.2082966Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.2083715Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.2084046Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.2084198Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.2084364Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.2084613Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.2084807Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.2085422Z    can use Nix.
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.2085582Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.2085675Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.2085826Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.2086196Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.2086638Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.2090598Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.2090765Z I will:
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.2091061Z 
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.2091528Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.2092116Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.2092968Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.2093701Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.2094156Z  - install Nix in /nix
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.2094590Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.2095502Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.2096138Z    /root
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.2106499Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.2107224Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.2118084Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
WebUI i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:40.2118636Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
