API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:41.0601001Z 
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:41.0601390Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:41.0602233Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
