API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:41.0604154Z 
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:41.0604781Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
API i18n health	Install Nix	2026-10-13T08:47:41.0605810Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
